---
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-[#ebebeb] bg-[#fafafa] py-12 text-[#4d4d4d] dark:border-[#262626] dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Theory -->
      <div class="space-y-3 md:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#171717] text-white preserve-dark">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold preserve-text">PL</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed]">PigmentLab</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#8f8f8f] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">
          Realistic physical color tools based on subtractive pigment absorption physics and Johannes Itten's Bauhaus RYB color theory.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-[#a1a1a1] dark:text-[#737373]">
          © {new Date().getFullYear()} pigmentlab.com · Free for commercial and creative use.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Core Tools -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#171717] uppercase dark:text-[#ededed]">Tools</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs">
          <li>
            <a href="/mix" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#171717] dark:hover:text-white">
              Color Mixer <span class="rounded bg-[#f2f2f2] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#4d4d4d] dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">Paint Optics</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/color-wheel" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#171717] dark:hover:text-white">
              Color Wheel Picker <span class="rounded bg-[#f2f2f2] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#4d4d4d] dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">Itten RYB</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#171717] dark:hover:text-white">
              PigmentLab Overview <span class="rounded bg-[#f2f2f2] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#4d4d4d] dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">Specs</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/mix" class="text-[#8f8f8f] transition-colors hover:text-[#171717] dark:text-[#737373] dark:hover:text-white">
              Mezcla de Colores / Farbensimulator
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Color Science & Modes -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#171717] uppercase dark:text-[#ededed]">Color Science</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#8f8f8f] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">
          <li><span class="text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#d4d4d4]">Kubelka-Munk (K/S):</span> Subtractive paint mixing</li>
          <li><span class="text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#d4d4d4]">Itten 12-Hue RYB:</span> Traditional artist wheel</li>
          <li><span class="text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#d4d4d4]">OKLCH & OKLab:</span> CSS Color Module 4</li>
          <li><span class="text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#d4d4d4]">WCAG 2.1:</span> AA / AAA contrast validation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Competitive Advantage -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#171717] uppercase dark:text-[#ededed]">Why PigmentLab</h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#8f8f8f] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">
          Standard screen utilities average RGB channels into dull brownish-grey. PigmentLab simulates true physical light absorption and Bauhaus color theory — giving creators the precision of physical pigments with modern CSS exports.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-between border-t border-[#ebebeb] pt-6 text-[11px] text-[#8f8f8f] sm:flex-row dark:border-[#262626] dark:text-[#737373]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Designed with Geist Design System</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Built with Astro & Tailwind v4</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-2 flex gap-3 sm:mt-0">
        <span class="font-mono text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed]">pigmentlab.com</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

